        {
          "kind": "text",
          "text": "Here is a simple SVG illustration of a pelican riding a bicycle. You can copy the code into an `.svg` file or embed it directly in HTML.\n\n```svg\n<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"\n     width=\"400\" height=\"300\"\n     viewBox=\"0 0 400 300\"\n     aria-labelledby=\"title\"\n     role=\"img\">\n  <title id=\"title\">Pelican on a bicycle</title>\n\n  <!-- Bicycle -->\n  <!-- Wheels -->\n  <circle cx=\"100\" cy=\"250\" r=\"30\" fill=\"#dddddd\" stroke=\"#555555\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n  <circle cx=\"300\" cy=\"250\" r=\"30\" fill=\"#dddddd\" stroke=\"#555555\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n  <!-- Spokes (simple) -->\n  <line x1=\"100\" y1=\"220\" x2=\"100\" y2=\"280\" stroke=\"#555555\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n  <line x1=\"70\"  y1=\"250\" x2=\"130\" y2=\"250\" stroke=\"#555555\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n  <line x1=\"300\" y1=\"220\" x2=\"300\" y2=\"280\" stroke=\"#555555\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n  <line x1=\"270\" y1=\"250\" x2=\"330\" y2=\"250\" stroke=\"#555555\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n\n  <!-- Frame -->\n  <path d=\"M130 220   % rear axle to seat tube\n           L170 150   % seat tube up\n           L210 180   % top tube\n           L250 150   % seat tube down to rear axle (simplified)\n           L250 220   % chain stay\n           Z\"\n        fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#555555\" stroke-width=\"4\"/>\n  <!-- Seat -->\n  <ellipse cx=\"190\" cy=\"150\" rx=\"15\" ry=\"8\" fill=\"#555555\"/>\n  <!-- Handlebars -->\n  <path d=\"M210 180\n           L190 150   % stem\n           L170 130   % left bar\n           M190 150\n           L210 130\"  % right bar\n        fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#555555\" stroke-width=\"4\"/>\n\n  <!-- Pelican -->\n  <!-- Body -->\n  <ellipse cx=\"190\" cy=\"130\" rx=\"30\" ry=\"20\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#555555\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n  <!-- Wing (simple curved shape) -->\n  <path d=\"M160 115\n           q-20 -10 -30 10\n           l0 20\n           q20 10 30 -10\n           Z\"\n        fill=\"#e0e0e0\" stroke=\"#555555\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n  <!-- Head -->\n  <circle cx=\"220\" cy=\"115\" r=\"12\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#555555\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n  <!-- Beak -->\n  <polygon points=\"232,115 260,115 246,100\"\n           fill=\"#ff8c00\" stroke=\"#555555\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n  <!-- Eye -->\n  <circle cx=\"224\" cy=\"110\" r=\"2\" fill=\"#000000\"/>\n  <!-- Legs (simple) -->\n  <line x1=\"180\" y1=\"150\" x2=\"170\" y2=\"180\" stroke=\"#555555\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n  <line x1=\"200\" y1=\"150\" x2=\"210\" y2=\"180\" stroke=\"#555555\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n</svg>\n```\n\nFeel free to adjust colors, sizes, or line styles to suit your needs. Enjoy!",
